# SCENARIO: baseline_b8_party_trade   SEED: 0   CAMERAS: none   BOTCFG: auto
# Phase 3 (lean) baseline B8 — party invite/accept + trade open/cancel. NORMAL AI (pinned bots
# decline every invite by design, bot_party.cpp "pinned"). Client truth: see_msg party lines,
# see_creature shield changes, trade_own / trade_close events (new harness verbs party/trade).
# Server truth: journal [PINVITE] detected/accepted latencyMs. Metrics: baseline_metrics.py b8.
@p1 login
# avoid the teleporter at (32352,32221,7): come in along the y=32215 street
@p1 goto 32369,32215,7 range=2 stuck=15 timeout=120
@p1 goto 32351,32215,7 range=2 stuck=15 timeout=120
@p1 goto 32347,32218,7 range=2 stuck=15 timeout=120
@p1 wait-see any-bot timeout=120 as=PB1
@p1 party invite $PB1
@p1 hold 30 watch=$PB1
@p1 party leave
@p1 hold 5
@p1 wait-see any-bot not=$PB1 timeout=120 as=PB2
@p1 party invite $PB2
@p1 hold 30 watch=$PB2
@p1 party leave
@p1 hold 5
@p1 wait-see any-bot not=$PB1,$PB2 timeout=120 as=PB3
@p1 party invite $PB3
@p1 hold 30 watch=$PB3
@p1 party leave
@p1 hold 5
@p1 wait-see any-bot timeout=60 as=TB1
@p1 trade $TB1 slot=1 optional=1
@p1 hold 5
@p1 trade cancel
@p1 hold 3
@p1 wait-see any-bot not=$TB1 timeout=60 as=TB2
@p1 trade $TB2 slot=1 optional=1
@p1 hold 5
@p1 trade cancel
@p1 hold 3
@srv expect src=srv msg~="PINVITE" min=1 within=400 optional=1
@p1 logout
